<div class="container">
  <div class="aboutWrap mt_100"><p>CCP Global represents 40 Primary Members and 5 Observer Members who operate over 60 individual CCPs globally across the Americas, EMEA, and the Asia-Pacific region.</p><p>We welcome enquiries from CCPs for exchange-traded business or OTC markets. For information about joining CCP Global, please contact the CCP Global Office at <a href="mailto:office@ccp-global.org">office@ccp-global.org</a>.</p></div>
</div>
